# Docs/binaries lớn
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.svg
**/*.ico

# Build/venv/cache
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/.nuxt/**
**/.output/**
**/.terraform/**
**/.terragrunt-cache/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**

# Package manager files
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/.pnpm-store/**

# TypeScript/JavaScript build artifacts
**/*.js.map
**/*.d.ts.map
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Charts vendored / generated
**/charts/**/charts/**
**/generated/**

# Học liệu nặng không cần index
learning/**/books/**
books/**

# Hệ điều hành/IDE rác
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/**
**/.vscode/**
**/.history/**
**/.cursor/**

# Terraform lock/state (đã theo dõi state ở backend thì bỏ qua lock cho nhẹ)
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Docker
**/docker-compose.override.yml
**/.dockerignore

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/**

# Test coverage
**/coverage/**
**/.nyc_output/**

# Environment files (có thể chứa secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Build artifacts cho các service repos
**/backend/packages/**/dist/**
**/backend/packages/**/build/**
**/frontend/dist/**
**/frontend/build/**
**/data-manager/dist/**
**/data-manager/build/**

# Cypress test artifacts
**/cypress/videos/**
**/cypress/screenshots/**

# Turbo build cache
**/.turbo/**

# Database files
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
